+<body>
+<main>
+<header class='doc-head'>
+<h1>Local Wisper Flow, GUI design reference (D0)</h1>
+<p class='cap'>Reference for color and spacing only, not a pixel spec. Values shown are samples.</p>
+<p class='cap'>Fonts shown are system stand-ins. EB Garamond, Inter and Noto Sans Devanagari are proposed and not yet added.</p>
+<p class='cap'>Branch feature/gui-redesign, cut from origin/main at 8e4945a. Written 2026-11-04.</p>
+<p class='toc'>Contents: <a href='#palette'>Palette and contrast</a>, <a href='#mini'>Mini mode</a>, <a href='#home'>Full app, Home</a>, <a href='#speech'>Full app, Speech</a>, <a href='#tokens'>Type, spacing and motion</a></p>
+</header>
+<section id='palette'><h2>1. Palette and contrast</h2><p class='cap'>Every ratio is computed with the WCAG relative-luminance formula from the exact tokens below. Body text needs 4.5:1, large text, icons and meaningful borders 3:1.</p><div class='theme-block'><h3>Dark theme, Hunter and Brass</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Value</th><th></th><th>Used for</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='mono'>bg</td><td class='mono'>#0E1714</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#0E1714'></span></td><td>page background</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>surface</td><td class='mono'>#14221D</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#14221D'></span></td><td>cards, rail, mini background</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>border</td><td class='mono'>#29392F</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#29392F'></span></td><td>1 px hairlines</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>text</td><td class='mono'>#EDE6D6</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#EDE6D6'></span></td><td>primary text</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>muted</td><td class='mono'>#A8B3AA</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#A8B3AA'></span></td><td>secondary text</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>accent</td><td class='mono'>#C9A96E</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#C9A96E'></span></td><td>brass in dark, navy in light</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>brass</td><td class='mono'>#C9A96E</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#C9A96E'></span></td><td>brass as text and icons in light</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>ok</td><td class='mono'>#8FB39A</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#8FB39A'></span></td><td>Ready</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>warn</td><td class='mono'>#D0A65A</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#D0A65A'></span></td><td>restart notes</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>err</td><td class='mono'>#D98A8F</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#D98A8F'></span></td><td>error copy</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>err_fill</td><td class='mono'>#B5565F</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#B5565F'></span></td><td>attention dot</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>focus</td><td class='mono'>#C9A96E</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#C9A96E'></span></td><td>focus ring, 2 px</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th>Pair</th><th>Against</th><th>Usage</th><th>Ratio</th><th>Needs</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#EDE6D6'></span>text</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#0E1714'></span>bg</td><td>body text on the page background</td><td class='num'>14.67:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#EDE6D6'></span>text</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>body text on cards</td><td class='num'>13.23:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#A8B3AA'></span>muted</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#0E1714'></span>bg</td><td>page subtitles on the page background</td><td class='num'>8.42:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#A8B3AA'></span>muted</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>helper text on cards</td><td class='num'>7.59:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#C9A96E'></span>accent</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>active nav label and primary accents</td><td class='num'>7.35:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#8FB39A'></span>ok</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>Ready status line</td><td class='num'>7.12:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#D0A65A'></span>warn</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>Applies after restart notes</td><td class='num'>7.27:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#D98A8F'></span>err</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>error copy</td><td class='num'>6.25:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#C9A96E'></span>focus</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#0E1714'></span>bg</td><td>focus ring on the page background</td><td class='num'>8.15:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#C9A96E'></span>focus</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>focus ring on cards</td><td class='num'>7.35:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#C9A96E'></span>accent</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>filled mic icon, active toggle track</td><td class='num'>7.35:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#8FB39A'></span>ok</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>status dot</td><td class='num'>7.12:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#B5565F'></span>err_fill</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>attention dot</td><td class='num'>3.50:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#0E1714'></span>on_accent</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#C9A96E'></span>accent</td><td>primary button label</td><td class='num'>8.15:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#29392F'></span>border</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#0E1714'></span>bg</td><td>1 px hairline between page and card</td><td class='num'>1.49:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='fail'>below</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#29392F'></span>border</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#14221D'></span>surface</td><td>1 px hairline between card and page</td><td class='num'>1.35:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='fail'>below</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class='theme-block'><h3>Light theme, Ivory and Navy</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Value</th><th></th><th>Used for</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='mono'>bg</td><td class='mono'>#F6F1E4</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#F6F1E4'></span></td><td>page background</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>surface</td><td class='mono'>#FFFDF7</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span></td><td>cards, rail, mini background</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>border</td><td class='mono'>#D9CFBA</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#D9CFBA'></span></td><td>1 px hairlines</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>text</td><td class='mono'>#1C2B26</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#1C2B26'></span></td><td>primary text</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>muted</td><td class='mono'>#5B665F</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#5B665F'></span></td><td>secondary text</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>accent</td><td class='mono'>#1F3A5F</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#1F3A5F'></span></td><td>brass in dark, navy in light</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>brass</td><td class='mono'>#7A5C25</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#7A5C25'></span></td><td>brass as text and icons in light</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>ok</td><td class='mono'>#3F6B52</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#3F6B52'></span></td><td>Ready</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>warn</td><td class='mono'>#7A5C25</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#7A5C25'></span></td><td>restart notes</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>err</td><td class='mono'>#7A2E3A</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#7A2E3A'></span></td><td>error copy</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>err_fill</td><td class='mono'>#7A2E3A</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#7A2E3A'></span></td><td>attention dot</td></tr><tr><td class='mono'>focus</td><td class='mono'>#1F3A5F</td><td><span class='swatch big' style='background:#1F3A5F'></span></td><td>focus ring, 2 px</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th>Pair</th><th>Against</th><th>Usage</th><th>Ratio</th><th>Needs</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#1C2B26'></span>text</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#F6F1E4'></span>bg</td><td>body text on the page background</td><td class='num'>13.09:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#1C2B26'></span>text</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>body text on cards</td><td class='num'>14.51:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#5B665F'></span>muted</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#F6F1E4'></span>bg</td><td>page subtitles on the page background</td><td class='num'>5.30:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#5B665F'></span>muted</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>helper text on cards</td><td class='num'>5.88:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#1F3A5F'></span>accent</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>active nav label and primary accents</td><td class='num'>11.29:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#3F6B52'></span>ok</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>Ready status line</td><td class='num'>6.01:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#7A5C25'></span>warn</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>Applies after restart notes</td><td class='num'>6.10:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#7A2E3A'></span>err</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>error copy</td><td class='num'>9.06:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#7A5C25'></span>brass</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>brass as text and icons in light</td><td class='num'>6.10:1</td><td class='num'>4.5:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#1F3A5F'></span>focus</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#F6F1E4'></span>bg</td><td>focus ring on the page background</td><td class='num'>10.18:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#1F3A5F'></span>focus</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>focus ring on cards</td><td class='num'>11.29:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#1F3A5F'></span>accent</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>filled mic icon, active toggle track</td><td class='num'>11.29:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#3F6B52'></span>ok</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>status dot</td><td class='num'>6.01:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#7A2E3A'></span>err_fill</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>attention dot</td><td class='num'>9.06:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#F6F1E4'></span>on_accent</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#1F3A5F'></span>accent</td><td>primary button label</td><td class='num'>10.18:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='pass'>pass</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#D9CFBA'></span>border</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#F6F1E4'></span>bg</td><td>1 px hairline between page and card</td><td class='num'>1.37:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='fail'>below</td></tr><tr><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#D9CFBA'></span>border</td><td><span class='swatch' style='background:#FFFDF7'></span>surface</td><td>1 px hairline between card and page</td><td class='num'>1.52:1</td><td class='num'>3.0:1</td><td class='fail'>below</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class='notice'>The two hairline border pairs (border on bg, border on surface) sit below 3:1 in both themes. They are decorative separators between surfaces that already differ in tone, and every state that carries meaning is also shown in text or shape. The recommendation is to keep the exact palette and exempt these two pairs in the contrast test, documented in ThemePalette.h. If you prefer borders to pass 3:1 as well, the border tokens need a nudge, which changes the palette.</div></section><section id='mini'><h2>2. Mini mode, dot and pill</h2><p class='cap'>Always on top, never takes keyboard focus, no taskbar button. The badge background is the surface token at 88 percent in dark and 90 percent in light, over whatever is on screen. Ready sits at 55 percent opacity and rises on hover. No transcript text is ever shown here.</p><div class='theme-block'><h3>Dark theme, Hunter and Brass</h3><p class='cap'>Left of each pair is the dot style, 44 by 44. Right is the pill style, 168 by 40. The strip behind them is a simulated desktop, not a token. The default style is the dot. Hover the attention badge to read its message.</p><div class='desktop-sim' style='background:#1D2420;color:#D8D4C4'><div class='mini-cell'><div class='mini-pair'><span class='mini-dot ready' style='background:rgba(20,34,29,0.88);border-color:#29392F;color:#EDE6D6'><svg class='mic' width='22' height='22' viewBox='0 0 24 24' aria-hidden='true' opacity='0.55'><rect x='8.5' y='3' width='7' height='11' rx='3.5' fill='none' stroke='#EDE6D6' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M5.5 11a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0' fill='none' stroke='#EDE6D6' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='12' y1='17.5' x2='12' y2='21' stroke='#EDE6D6' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round'/></svg></span><span class='mini-pill' style='background:rgba(20,34,29,0.88);border-color:#29392F;color:#EDE6D6'><span class='pill-icon'><svg class='mic' width='18' height='18' viewBox='0 0 24 24' aria-hidden='true' opacity='0.55'><rect x='8.5' y='3' width='7' height='11' rx='3.5' fill='none' stroke='#EDE6D6' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M5.5 11a6.5 6.5 0 0 0 13 0' fill='none' stroke='#EDE6D6' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='12' y1='17.5' x2='12' y2='21' stroke='#EDE6D6' stroke-width='1.6' stroke-linecap='round'/></svg></span><span class='pill-label' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Ready</span></span></div><div class='mini-name'>Ready</div><div class='mini-note'>outline mic, whole badge at 55 percent opacity, 100 on hover</div></div><div class='mini-cell'><div class='mini-pair'><span class='mini-dot listening' style='background:rgba(20,34,29,0.88);border-color:#29392F;color:#EDE6D6'><span class='ring' style='border-color:#C9A