div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class='theme-block'><h3>Trust card when cloud speech is on</h3><p class='cap'>The Home page shows this variant whenever cloud speech is on. It stays visible the whole time cloud is on.</p><div class='window slim' style='background:#0E1714;border-color:#29392F'><div class='content'><div class='cards'><div class='card' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F'><div class='card-title' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Trust</div><div class='card-body'><div style='color:#EDE6D6'>Speech is sent to Gnani for each sentence. Last sent: 2 min ago.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id='speech'><h2>4. Full app, Speech</h2><div class='theme-block'><h3>Dark theme, Hunter and Brass</h3><p class='cap'>Window 960 by 640 by default, minimum 760 by 520, native title bar. Rail 208 px. Content padding 32 px, widest 640 px, left aligned. The title bar strip is a simulation of the system one, not a token.</p><div class='window' style='background:#0E1714;border-color:#29392F'><div class='titlebar' style='background:#1C1C1C'><span class='tb-title' style='color:#EDE6D6;opacity:0.85'>Local Wisper Flow</span><span class='tb-controls'><span class='tb-glyph'></span><span class='tb-glyph square'></span><span class='tb-glyph x'></span></span></div><div class='window-body'><div class='rail' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F'><div class='wordmark' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Local Wisper Flow</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Home</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Dictation</div><div class='nav-item active' style='color:#EDE6D6'><span class='nav-bar' style='background:#C9A96E'></span>Speech</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Cleanup</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Dictionary</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Snippets</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>History</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Privacy</div><div class='nav-item' style='color:#A8B3AA'>About</div><div class='rail-bottom'><span class='status'><span class='dot' style='background:#8FB39A'></span><span style='color:#EDE6D6'>&nbsp;Ready</span></span><div class='switch-mini' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Switch to mini</div></div></div><div class='content'><div class='page-title' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Speech</div><div class='page-sub' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Choose how your speech is turned into text.</div><div class='cards'><div class='card' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F'><div class='card-title' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Speech on this computer</div><div class='card-body'><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Speech model</div></div><div class='row-control'><span class='value' style='color:#EDE6D6'>English and Hindi, 244 MB</span><span class='status'><span class='dot' style='background:#8FB39A'></span><span style='color:#EDE6D6'>&nbsp;Ready</span></span></div></div><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Language</div></div><div class='row-control'><span class='dropdown' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F;color:#EDE6D6'><span>Hindi (हिन्दी)</span><span class='chev' style='border-top-color:#A8B3AA'></span></span></div></div><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Use graphics card</div><div class='helper' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Runs the speech model on the graphics card when one is available.</div><div class='note' style='color:#D0A65A'>Applies after restart.</div></div><div class='row-control'><span class='toggle on' style='background:#C9A96E'><span class='knob' style='right:4px;background:#14221D;border:none'></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class='card' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F'><div class='card-title' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Cloud speech (optional)</div><div class='card-body'><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#EDE6D