lass='switch-mini' style='color:#5B665F'>Switch to mini</div></div></div><div class='content'><div class='page-title' style='color:#1C2B26'>Speech</div><div class='page-sub' style='color:#5B665F'>Choose how your speech is turned into text.</div><div class='cards'><div class='card' style='background:#FFFDF7;border-color:#D9CFBA'><div class='card-title' style='color:#1C2B26'>Speech on this computer</div><div class='card-body'><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#1C2B26'>Speech model</div></div><div class='row-control'><span class='value' style='color:#1C2B26'>English and Hindi, 244 MB</span><span class='status'><span class='dot' style='background:#3F6B52'></span><span style='color:#1C2B26'>&nbsp;Ready</span></span></div></div><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#1C2B26'>Language</div></div><div class='row-control'><span class='dropdown' style='background:#FFFDF7;border-color:#D9CFBA;color:#1C2B26'><span>Hindi (हिन्दी)</span><span class='chev' style='border-top-color:#5B665F'></span></span></div></div><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#1C2B26'>Use graphics card</div><div class='helper' style='color:#5B665F'>Runs the speech model on the graphics card when one is available.</div><div class='note' style='color:#7A5C25'>Applies after restart.</div></div><div class='row-control'><span class='toggle on' style='background:#1F3A5F'><span class='knob' style='right:4px;background:#FFFDF7;border:none'></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class='card' style='background:#FFFDF7;border-color:#D9CFBA'><div class='card-title' style='color:#1C2B26'>Cloud speech (optional)</div><div class='card-body'><div class='row'><div class='row-label'><div class='label' style='color:#1C2B26'>Use cloud speech for better Indian languages</div><div class='helper' style='color:#5B665F'>Off by default. When on, each sentence is sent to Gnani over the internet while you dictate.</div></div><div class='row-control'><span class='toggle off' style='background:#D9CFBA'><span class='knob' style='left:4px;background:#FFFDF7;border:1px solid #D9CFBA'></span></span></div></div><div class='helper' style='color:#5B665F'>Cloud speech is off.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id='tokens'><h2>5. Type, spacing, radii, controls and motion</h2><div class='theme-block'><h3>Type scale, spacing, radii and controls, shown in the dark theme</h3><div class='token-grid'><div><div class='token-h'>Type scale</div><div class='type-row'><span class='type-sample s1' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Home</span><span class='cap'>28 px, serif, page title</span></div><div class='type-row'><span class='type-sample s2' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Local Wisper Flow</span><span class='cap'>18 px, serif, wordmark</span></div><div class='type-row'><span class='type-sample s3' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Right now</span><span class='cap'>15 px, sans, medium, section title</span></div><div class='type-row'><span class='type-sample s4' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Hold to speak, release to type.</span><span class='cap'>14 px, sans, body and controls</span></div><div class='type-row'><span class='type-sample s5' style='color:#EDE6D6'>Applies after restart.</span><span class='cap'>13 px, sans, helper text</span></div></div><div><div class='token-h'>Spacing, 8 px grid</div><div class='space-row'><span class='space-bar' style='width:12px;background:#C9A96E'></span><span class='cap'>4 px</span></div><div class='space-row'><span class='space-bar' style='width:24px;background:#C9A96E'></span><span class='cap'>8 px</span></div><div class='space-row'><span class='space-bar' style='width:48px;background:#C9A96E'></span><span class='cap'>16 px</span></div><div class='space-row'><span class='space-bar' style='width:72px;background:#C9A96E'></span><span class='cap'>24 px</span></div><div class='space-row'><span class='space-bar' style='width:96px;background:#C9A96E'></span><span class='cap'>32 px</span></div><div class='token-h' style='margin-top:16px'>Corner radii</div><div class='radii-row'><span class='radius-chip r6' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F;color:#A8B3AA'>6 px, controls</span><span class='radius-chip r10' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F;color:#A8B3AA'>10 px, cards</span><span class='radius-chip r999' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F;color:#A8B3AA'>round, mini</span></div><div class='token-h' style='margin-top:16px'>Focus ring, 2 px</div><span class='focus-sample' style='outline-color:#C9A96E;color:#EDE6D6;background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F'>Speech model</span></div><div><div class='token-h'>Controls, at least 32 px tall</div><div class='controls-strip'><span class='btn primary' style='background:#C9A96E;color:#0E1714'>Continue</span><span class='btn' style='border-color:#A8B3AA;color:#EDE6D6'>Copy</span><span class='toggle on' style='background:#C9A96E'><span class='knob' style='right:4px;background:#14221D;border:none'></span></span><span class='toggle off' style='background:#29392F'><span class='knob' style='left:4px;background:#14221D;border:1px solid #29392F'></span></span><span class='dropdown' style='background:#14221D;border-color:#29392F;color:#EDE6D6'><span>Hindi (हिन्दी)</span><span class='chev' style='border-top-color:#A8B3AA'></span></span><span class='chip' style='background:#0E1714;border-color:#29392F;color:#EDE6D6'>Ctrl</span><span class='chip-plus' style='color:#A8B3AA'>+</span><span class='chip' style='background:#0E1714;border-color:#29392F;color:#EDE6D6'>Win</span><span class='saved' style='color:#A8B3AA'>Saved</span><span class='note' style='color:#D0A65A'>Applies after restart.</span></div><div class='token-h' style='margin-top:16px'>Motion</div><table class='mini-table'><tbody><tr><td>Mini, Listening ring</td><td>2.4 s cycle, opacity 60 to 100, ease in and out</td></tr><tr><td>Mini, Thinking dots</td><td>one dot every 300 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Mini, Done check</td><td>600 ms, then fade to Ready</td></tr><tr><td>Mini, Attention message</td><td>clears after 6 s or on the next dictation</td></tr><tr><td>Theme switch and page change</td><td>150 to 240 ms, ease-out</td></tr><tr><td>Saved note</td><td>1.5 s, then it disappears</td></tr><tr><td>Reduce motion</td><td>ring and dots become static, everything else unchanged</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section>
